{"id":"cf9a99b4e5130a3a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-persistent-homology.md","title":"Persistent Homology","display":"df-persistent-homology — Persistent Homology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-persistent-homology","aliases":["58-df-persistent-homology"],"display":"df-persistent-homology — Persistent Homology","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-persistent-homology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-persistent-homology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-persistent-homology — Persistent Homology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,R,\\mathcal H,\\Phi,H,i,j\\in V\">\\(I,R,\\mathcal H,\\Phi,H,i,j\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PersistentHomology}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{PersistentHomology}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}persistence\\text{-}module}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S(\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(I,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal H,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal H))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi,R,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi(\\langle i,i\\rangle),\\mathcal H(i),\\mathcal H(i))\n\\land\\Phi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal H(i)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\mathcal H(i),\\mathcal H(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\Phi(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\n=\\Phi(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}persistence\\text{-}module}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S(\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(I,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal H,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal H))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi,R,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi(\\langle i,i\\rangle),\\mathcal H(i),\\mathcal H(i))\n\\land\\Phi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal H(i)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\mathcal H(i),\\mathcal H(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\Phi(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\n=\\Phi(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}persistent\\text{-}homology} \\vdash \\mathrm{PersistentHomology}_S(H,\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R,i,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S(\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R)\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land H=\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}persistent\\text{-}homology} \\vdash \\mathrm{PersistentHomology}_S(H,\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R,i,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S(\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R)\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land H=\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H(i)\">\\(\\mathcal H(i)\\)</span> is a homology object of the filtration stage at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\">\\(\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\)</span> is induced by inclusion, the relation above is the corresponding persistent homology image.</li>\n<li>The homology construction and its induced maps are explicit parameters rather than untracked ambient notation.</li>\n<li>Persistence measures homology across filtration scales.</li>\n<li>Barcode visualization shows birth/death of topological features.</li>\n<li>Stability: small changes in data <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> small changes in barcode.</li>\n<li>Applications: shape recognition, material science, bioinformatics.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,R,\\mathcal H,\\Phi,H,i,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PersistentHomology}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}persistence\\text{-}module}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S(\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Poset}(I,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal H,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal H))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi,R,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi(\\langle i,i\\rangle),\\mathcal H(i),\\mathcal H(i))\n\\land\\Phi(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal H(i)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\mathcal H(i),\\mathcal H(j))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\Phi(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\n=\\Phi(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}persistent\\text{-}homology} \\vdash \\mathrm{PersistentHomology}_S(H,\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R,i,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PersistenceModule}_S(\\mathcal H,\\Phi,I,R)\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land H=\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal H(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi(\\langle i,j\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to","display":false}],"bytes":2181,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-953","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-persistent-homology.md|58-df-persistent-homology]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","36d7463d215be751"]}